                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ec1fc89d-ac5b-3584-b90b-75cd1e176041",
                        "entry_id": "d465362d-f4ed-34f7-92a7-321f1b61c097",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Wesen, das seine Gestalt verändern kann"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "40161361-3d5b-4ba0-9d67-91ab17595236",
                                "sense_id": "ec1fc89d-ac5b-3584-b90b-75cd1e176041",
                                "text": "„Der Gestaltwandler verstand ihre Schreckensangst, wusste jedoch, dass sie seine Herkunft verkannte.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "10e976b1-7871-408b-8787-3f8382cb91ce",
                                "sense_id": "ec1fc89d-ac5b-3584-b90b-75cd1e176041",
                                "text": "„Sie hat sich nicht zum Duschen ausgezogen, sondern um sich von etwaigen Hemmnissen der bevorstehenden körperlichen Transformation zu befreien, im Vergleich zu der sich Legenden über Werwölfe und andere Gestaltwandler banal ausnehmen.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3e8d85e4-ca62-49e8-ab5c-62865818d7b1",
                        "source_entry_id": "d465362d-f4ed-34f7-92a7-321f1b61c097",
                        "source_sense_id": "ec1fc89d-ac5b-3584-b90b-75cd1e176041",
                        "source_sense_description": "Wesen, das seine Gestalt verändern kann",
                        "target_lang_word": "shapeshifter",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "shapeshifter",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5b08c1dd-0928-3e77-87d5-e94a42aaf73c",
                                        "entry_id": "97ad2d15-d255-33aa-b2f4-14bcaa0c77a6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person or creature capable of changing their appearance or form at will."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1f75106-de33-41d3-8ae1-c2f62ac5b27f",
                                                "sense_id": "5b08c1dd-0928-3e77-87d5-e94a42aaf73c",
                                                "text": "The shapeshifter Lisa Bowalk, unable to shed the guise of a black panther, had gone onto the plain as a prisoner but was not now to be found among the dead above or the Captured down below."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "273b087d-69fc-4f16-9dd8-fcb315f6772e",
                                                "sense_id": "5b08c1dd-0928-3e77-87d5-e94a42aaf73c",
                                                "text": "Like the teller of shapeshifter stories—who conjures a shifting world of perceptions and expectations for his or her audience that is strikingly similar to the worlds created by the shapeshifter for its victims—the cultural practice of imagination...is an inherently shifty enterprise...."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "430a9f11-f7c1-4585-bcc9-922c4490aa69",
                                                "sense_id": "5b08c1dd-0928-3e77-87d5-e94a42aaf73c",
                                                "text": "There have also been verified reports of fire-starters and ice-makers and a shapeshifter so powerful she was able to frame another Smallville citizen for a bank robbery!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "496e2478-61c6-4b38-81ca-e219d4aeeffb",
                                                "sense_id": "5b08c1dd-0928-3e77-87d5-e94a42aaf73c",
                                                "text": "Granted, Grace is talking about actual transformation, but she's a shapeshifter. For her, growing a couple inches taller is like an alternative to wearing high heels."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1f32990-d75e-494a-b411-43c76c7cd5fd",
                                                "sense_id": "5b08c1dd-0928-3e77-87d5-e94a42aaf73c",
                                                "text": "“The Jem'Hadar? You fought the Dominion? Ah. The shapeshifters sent many warriors to Sto-vo-kor. I wish I could have seen it.” “No, you do not. There was no honor, just massacres.” “But in the end you were victorious.” “Starfleet is supposed to be about puzzling together the mysteries of life, not fighting wars. I don't want to be a general. I don't, I don't want to send my friends off to die. I just want to be an ensign. If it was good enough for Sito, then it's good enough for me.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0c259a4-68bb-4cbf-9b0f-5f8d95a8f8dd",
                                                "sense_id": "5b08c1dd-0928-3e77-87d5-e94a42aaf73c",
                                                "text": "“Oh, no! That house belongs to shapeshifters. [spits]” “Fuck.” “You're kidding me, right?” “Shapeshifters are... extremely freaky.” “They are awful, abhorrent creatures that use the most ancient of sorcery to transform into whatever murderous, all-powerful shape their wicked hearts desire. And now, they have infiltrated our street.” “I have had horrible experiences with shapeshifters in the past. I was once in a relationship with a woman for four years who then transformed into a possum. I stayed with her for six more months, but then I just had to end it.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0f53de08-dc0b-3fa5-ac13-8136b80a7e9c",
                                        "entry_id": "97ad2d15-d255-33aa-b2f4-14bcaa0c77a6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who is inconsistent and elusive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b1dbc63-8348-442a-a3eb-f1538f444c30",
                                                "sense_id": "0f53de08-dc0b-3fa5-ac13-8136b80a7e9c",
                                                "text": "She was an alcoholic, very chageable, very deceptive. A shapeshifter. You never knew where you stood with her, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e74bc823-6cb1-4071-8e6e-d23aaddaa40c",
                        "source_entry_id": "d465362d-f4ed-34f7-92a7-321f1b61c097",
